{{Top|legends=Star Cab}}
An '''Orlean star cab''' was a form of vehicle. When [[Syril Karn]] and a colleague were looking at a log of starships that came and went from [[Morlana One]], they wondered whether a ship that had recently taken off, might be an Orlean star cab or a [[Breon HOY-39 Dayvan|Breon Dayvan]].<ref name="Kassa">{{Andor|Kassa (episode)}}</ref>

